      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "start_ms": 21520,
      "end_ms": 21740,
      "text_en": "New York.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "start_ms": 22520,
      "end_ms": 22620,
      "text_en": "England.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "start_ms": 23380,
      "end_ms": 23500,
      "text_en": "Italy.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "start_ms": 24660,
      "end_ms": 26280,
      "text_en": "I'm from the states originally, from Pennsylvania.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "start_ms": 26860,
      "end_ms": 28820,
      "text_en": "I'm from the northwest of England, I live in London.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "start_ms": 29200,
      "end_ms": 30100,
      "text_en": "What do you like the most of London?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "start_ms": 30740,
      "end_ms": 32060,
      "text_en": "I love how diverse it is.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "start_ms": 32479,
      "end_ms": 36100,
      "text_en": "I think you can walk out of your door every day and find something completely different",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 37460,
      "text_en": "to without having a plan.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text_en": "Yeah, similar. Yeah, it's very varied.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "start_ms": 40780,
      "end_ms": 43660,
      "text_en": "It's like 100 different cities in London, which I really like.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "start_ms": 43900,
      "end_ms": 47780,
      "text_en": "It's kind of a confederation of places and just the world is your oyster.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "start_ms": 47940,
      "end_ms": 55340,
      "text_en": "The shops, best museums, best seats of learning in terms of scholastically.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 19,
      "start_ms": 57200,
      "end_ms": 59340,
      "text_en": "London is now the capital of the world.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 20,
      "start_ms": 60200,
      "end_ms": 61780,
      "text_en": "I love the hustle and bustle of it.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 21,
      "start_ms": 62080,
      "end_ms": 66280,
      "text_en": "There's always something going on and if you're interested you can find out",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 22,
      "start_ms": 66960,
      "end_ms": 68380,
      "text_en": "something interesting to go to.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 23,
      "start_ms": 69200,
      "end_ms": 70620,
      "text_en": "Yeah, saying there's lots to do.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 24,
      "start_ms": 70900,
      "end_ms": 73780,
      "text_en": "People come from all over the world to meet interesting people.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 25,
      "start_ms": 74900,
      "end_ms": 76340,
      "text_en": "What do I like the most about London?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 26,
      "start_ms": 77480,
      "end_ms": 78280,
      "text_en": "The diversity.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 27,
      "start_ms": 78680,
      "end_ms": 79460,
      "text_en": "The diversity.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 28,
      "start_ms": 80080,
      "end_ms": 86240,
      "text_en": "So, in London, I grew up in London and I left London at 18 and it was the first time",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 29,
      "start_ms": 86240,
      "end_ms": 94020,
      "text_en": "that I ever sort of experienced like, I don't know, racism was when I sort of first left",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 30,
      "start_ms": 94020,
      "end_ms": 97140,
      "text_en": "London because like here you grow up and you're just surrounded by it constantly",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 31,
      "start_ms": 97140,
      "end_ms": 103840,
      "text_en": "and growing up in that sort of environment is incredible.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 32,
      "start_ms": 104220,
      "end_ms": 108020,
      "text_en": "I think it's something that you take for granted if you live in London because",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 33,
      "start_ms": 108720,
      "end_ms": 111400,
      "text_en": "there's nowhere else in the world, quite like it I guess.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 34,
      "start_ms": 111600,
      "end_ms": 113880,
      "text_en": "It's just so many different kinds of people everywhere.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 35,
      "start_ms": 114300,
      "end_ms": 117920,
      "text_en": "The fact that it's cosmopolitan, it's lots of different ethnic groups.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 36,
      "start_ms": 118660,
      "end_ms": 119960,
      "text_en": "The weather, it's fantastic.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 37,
      "start_ms": 121380,
      "end_ms": 123380,
      "text_en": "Now, there's a very beautiful city.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 38,
      "start_ms": 123740,
      "end_ms": 125720,
      "text_en": "Lots of things to do, places like Portobello Market.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 39,
      "start_ms": 126260,
      "end_ms": 128919,
      "text_en": "The food is amazing as well and lots of different cultures.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 40,
      "start_ms": 129440,
      "end_ms": 131060,
      "text_en": "What would I recommend them to do?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 41,
      "start_ms": 131340,
      "end_ms": 133320,
      "text_en": "First of all, they have to do their research.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 42,
      "start_ms": 133740,
      "end_ms": 134760,
      "text_en": "It's a massive city.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 43,
      "start_ms": 135240,
      "end_ms": 138460,
      "text_en": "You can easily get lost, frightened, intimidated, not have a good time",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 44,
      "start_ms": 138460,
      "end_ms": 141380,
      "text_en": "then go home having had quite poor experience.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 45,
      "start_ms": 142160,
      "end_ms": 144340,
      "text_en": "So you have to learn, you know, you have to do your research.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 46,
      "start_ms": 144920,
      "end_ms": 145460,
      "text_en": "Where do you want to go?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 47,
      "start_ms": 145700,
      "end_ms": 149380,
      "text_en": "Which part? East, West, whatever, do some research, get stuck in.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 48,
      "start_ms": 149380,
      "end_ms": 151100,
      "text_en": "Walking around is the best start really.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 49,
      "start_ms": 151520,
      "end_ms": 153540,
      "text_en": "The city of London has actually got a lot of interesting history.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 50,
      "start_ms": 153980,
      "end_ms": 158520,
      "text_en": "So if you've got time, city in the West End, just to see what's going on,",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 51,
      "start_ms": 158700,
      "end_ms": 163400,
      "text_en": "it's kind of cheap things to do in London, which is not always easy.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 52,
      "start_ms": 164400,
      "end_ms": 165580,
      "text_en": "It's a wandering round, I think.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 53,
      "start_ms": 166140,
      "end_ms": 167560,
      "text_en": "Yeah, I would say the same actually.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 54,
      "start_ms": 168000,
      "end_ms": 170480,
      "text_en": "Just walk around and get to know the city and get a feel for the city",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 55,
      "start_ms": 170480,
      "end_ms": 172400,
      "text_en": "and go to as many different areas as possible.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 56,
      "start_ms": 172820,
      "end_ms": 175660,
      "text_en": "Noting Hill, Tower of London is fun.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 57,
      "start_ms": 176480,
      "end_ms": 178720,
      "text_en": "Definitely all the markets, the markets are really cool.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 58,
      "start_ms": 180660,
      "end_ms": 185120,
      "text_en": "Trying to think, just a mix of like the touristy and kind of local stuff",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 59,
      "start_ms": 185120,
      "end_ms": 186560,
      "text_en": "is really fun. Shortage is awesome.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 60,
      "start_ms": 186560,
      "end_ms": 187460,
      "text_en": "Shortage is great.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 61,
      "start_ms": 188060,
      "end_ms": 191820,
      "text_en": "I would definitely want South Bank for sure, and plenty of markets around London.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 62,
      "start_ms": 192640,
      "end_ms": 197840,
      "text_en": "Anywhere, Portobello, Camden, Barra, all those sorts of things.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 63,
      "start_ms": 198840,
      "end_ms": 200440,
      "text_en": "It's about walking around the city.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 64,
      "start_ms": 200720,
      "end_ms": 201900,
      "text_en": "How would you describe Londoners?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 65,
      "start_ms": 204700,
      "end_ms": 207500,
      "text_en": "I would say that they are self-contained.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 66,
      "start_ms": 208160,
      "end_ms": 212240,
      "text_en": "They don't interact with you very much if you don't ask them to.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 67,
      "start_ms": 212600,
      "end_ms": 213500,
      "text_en": "Some people say they're rude.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 68,
      "start_ms": 213780,
      "end_ms": 216260,
      "text_en": "Very generally, very friendly, very hopeful.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 69,
      "start_ms": 217260,
      "end_ms": 217880,
      "text_en": "Again, very diverse.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 70,
      "start_ms": 218820,
      "end_ms": 219880,
      "text_en": "That's a very difficult question.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 71,
      "start_ms": 220060,
      "end_ms": 221120,
      "text_en": "What is a Londoner these days?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 72,
      "start_ms": 221880,
      "end_ms": 225200,
      "text_en": "I'd like to say, friendly and outgoing, but that might not be true.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 73,
      "start_ms": 226200,
      "end_ms": 228520,
      "text_en": "If you've got a night switch, I don't think they're friendly and outgoing.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 74,
      "start_ms": 228520,
      "end_ms": 231400,
      "text_en": "So, it depends. It's using multicultural.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 75,
      "start_ms": 232120,
      "end_ms": 233700,
      "text_en": "Cool and open-minded.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 76,
      "start_ms": 234200,
      "end_ms": 234580,
      "text_en": "Fun.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 77,
      "start_ms": 235140,
      "end_ms": 237420,
      "text_en": "Welcoming, friendly, really back.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "A2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
